  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4905.01 Renewal Notice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4905.01 Renewal Notice.\n\n(a) The department shall notify the certificate holder by first class mail, at least 30 days prior to the expiration of a certificate the following:\n\n(1) The date that the certificate expires; and\n\n(2) The requirements for the renewal of the certificate, pursuant to these rules.\n\n(b) All renewal notices shall be sent to the certificate holder’s last known address.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4900.html"
}
